* PSpice behavioral macromodel (SpiceMeister test fixture)
.SUBCKT PSAMP INP INN OUT PARAMS: GAIN=1e5 VSAT=12
E_gain g 0 VALUE={LIMIT(GAIN*V(INP,INN),-VSAT,VSAT)}
R_out g OUT 100
G_nl 0 OUT VALUE={PWRS(V(g),2)*1u}
E_tab t 0 TABLE {V(g)} = (-1,-1)(0,0)(1,1)
R_t t 0 1k
.FUNC softclip(x) {LIMIT(x,-1,1)}
.ENDS PSAMP
